Item Model Fix (Itamio port for Minecraft 1.20.1)

This mod is an unofficial port of "Item Model Fix" by PepperCode1
(https://github.com/PepperCode1/Item-Model-Fix, LGPL-3.0-only),
originally for Minecraft 1.19.2 (Fabric).

All credit for the original concept, design, and logic goes to
PepperCode1. This port was created by Itamio to bring the mod to
Minecraft 1.20.1 (Forge) because the original has not been updated
to this version.

Itamio does not take credit for any of the original assets or logic.
The code was updated to be compatible with Minecraft 1.20.1 (Forge).

Port status: full port. On 1.20.1 the old baked-model
ItemModelGenerator
(net.minecraft.client.renderer.block.model.ItemModelGenerator) still
exists, so the complete original generation logic (VANILLA / UNLERP /
OUTLINE / PIXEL) is ported, hooked via a Mixin on
ItemModelGenerator.processFrames. The 26.3 (main) branch cannot do
this because that generator was removed in 26.3's new cuboid model
system — see that branch's README/NOTICE.
